    "Thème, style, couleur principale, palettes, fond, bordure : l'aperçu change en direct, et les flèches annulent ou rétablissent. Essaie :": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thema, Stil, Hauptfarbe, Paletten, Hintergrund, Rahmen: Die Vorschau ändert sich live, und die Pfeile machen Änderungen rückgängig oder stellen sie wieder her. Probier es aus:"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Theme, style, main color, palettes, background, border: the preview updates live, and the arrows undo or redo. Try it:"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tema, estilo, color principal, paletas, fondo, borde: la vista previa cambia en directo y las flechas deshacen o rehacen. Pruébalo:"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thème, style, couleur principale, palettes, fond, bordure : l'aperçu change en direct, et les flèches annulent ou rétablissent. Essaie :"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tema, stile, colore principale, palette, sfondo, bordo: l'anteprima cambia in tempo reale e le frecce annullano o ripristinano. Prova:"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "テーマ、スタイル、メインカラー、パレット、背景、枠線。プレビューはリアルタイムで変わり、矢印で取り消しややり直しができます。試してみてください："
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tema, estilo, cor principal, paletas, fundo, borda: a prévia muda ao vivo e as setas desfazem ou refazem. Experimente:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
